			"notes": "**DISCLAIMER:**\nGolden Frontier is currently in active development and is far from a finished product. Bugs are to be expected\nYou can report any bugs you find [here](https://github.com/locallupo/Golden-Frontier/issues)\n\n\n## ⛏️ ABOUT THE MOD ⛏️\nWho said a Western mod needs guns?\n\nAdventure into the world of prospecting at the peak of a gold rush with all new ways to find ores:\n\n- Use a Gold Pan in rivers to find valuable traces of gold\n- Trade with the Prospector Villager to sell your spoils\n- Rig dynamite charges to blow from a distance\n- Find all new Silver and Pyrite ores\n- Dress up in three different hat types, dyed to your style\n- Build your Western Town with all new Painted Planks\n\nGolden Frontier was developed for the 2026 CurseForge Modjam.\n\nThe mod is inspired by the Wild West and American Gold Rush.\n\nInformation about all of the features in the mod can be found on the [Golden Frontier Wiki](https://github.com/locallupo/Golden-Frontier/wiki)\n\n\n\n\n## 🏆 CREDITS 🏆\n\nModels, Textures and Mod developed by [locallupo](https://modrinth.com/user/locallupo)\n\nProgramming by [Ben McAvoy](https://www.curseforge.com/members/benmcavoy/projects)\n\n\n\n\n\n## 🪲 KNOWN BUGS 🪲\n\n- Dynamite Wire does not render with Shaders\n- Dynamite Wire renders differently at night"
